{"strings":["Declaration","Details related to any statement or action, in any form prescribed or accepted by the Government Agency, giving information or particulars required by the Governmental Agency.","Document issuing date/time","Date and time the document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Document issuing location identifier","Identification of the location at which a document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","UN/LOCODE","Total invoice amount","Amount indicating the total of all invoice amounts in a single declaration.","Number of loading lists","Quantity specifying the number of loading lists, manifests or similar documents.","CurrencyExchange","Details related to rate at which one specified currency is expressed in another specified currency.","Currency code","Code specifying a monetary unit or currency.","CurrencyCodeList","Exchange rate","Rate at which one specified currency is expressed in another specified currency.","GoodsShipment","Details related to the movement and the handling of goods shipped together on one or more means of transport between original consignor and final consignee.","Nature of transaction code","Code specifying the nature of a transaction associated with a shipment.","TransactionNatureTypeCodeList","Buyer","Details related to the party to which merchandise or services are sold.","Buyer name","Name of the party to which merchandise or services are sold.","Buyer identifier","Identification of a party to which merchandise or services are sold.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Address","Details related to an address.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","User code list","Contact","Details related to contact information of a department or employee.","Department or employee contact name","Name of a department or employee.","Communication","Details related to communication including number and number type.","Communication identifier","Identification of the communication address.","Communication number type code","Code specifying the type of communication address.","CommunicationMeansTypeCodeList","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document providing additional information.","Additional document issuing date/time","Date and time of issuing an additional document and when needed, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Language code","Code specifying the language used or requested.","LanguageCodeList","Additional document type code","Code specifying the type of an additional document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","CustomsValuation","Details related to valuation applying to the shipment.","Charges amount","Amount indicating the total cost of freight, insurance and all other costs and expenses from the foreign exit location to the entry location.","Freight costs amount","Amount indicating the total costs incurred by the shipper in moving goods, by whatever means, from one place to another under the terms of the contract of carriage. In addition to transport costs, this may include such elements as packing, documentation, loading, unloading, and insurance (i.e., to the extent that they relate to the freight cost).","Qualifier for apportioning freight charges code","Code specifying the method of the proportional allocation of freight charges for each consignment in a multi consignment declaration .","FreightChargeApportioningMethodCodeList","Valuation method code","Code specifying the method on which the customs value is determined.","ValuationMethodCodeList","Party relationship indicator code","Code specifying the effect of relationship existing between two parties such as financial relationship.","PartyRelationshipCodeList","Terms of payment code","Code specifying the terms of payment expressed in international terms (e.g., Cash on Delivery (COD), 30/60/90 due dates, discounts, commissions) under which transaction is completed.","PaymentTermsCodeList","ChargeDeduction","Details related to the charges and deductions relevant to customs value (e.g. international freight, insurance, and post importation charges for construction, erection).","Charges type code","Code specifying the type of charge or deduction.","UN/EDIFACT code list 5025","Other charges/deductions amount","Amount added or subtracted from the total invoice price (depending on the trade terms) not previously taken into account when determining the customs value.","LoadingLocation","Details related to the location at which the goods (i.e., consignments) are loaded on to the active means of transport.","Loading location name","Name of a seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which goods are loaded onto the means of transport being used for their carriage.","Loading location identifier","Identification of a seaport, airport, freight terminal, rail station or other location at which goods are loaded onto the means of transport being used for their carriage.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR User code list","Loading location departure date/time","Date and time / scheduled date and time of the goods departing from the place of loading.","Consignment loading date/time","Date and time of initial loading onto a ship or airplane during one journey from export location to import location.","GoodsItem","Details related to the goods item as declared to Government Agency.","Customs amount","Amount declared for customs purposes of those goods in a consignment which are subject to the same customs procedure, and have the same tariff/statistical heading, country information and duty regime.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Statistical amount","Amount indicating the value declared for statistical purposes of those goods in a consignment which have the same statistical heading.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","InvoiceLine","Details related to the line item of an invoice.","Item amount","Amount due for each chargeable item of goods or services.","ValuationAdjustment","Details related to valuation adjustments.","Valuation additions qualifier code","Code specifying the type of ˜WTO valuation agreement addition article 8: Price influence, Royalties, Assists, Proceeds, Commissions.","UN/EDIFACT code list 7365 subset (codes 145, 146, 147, 148 and 149) OR User codes","Valuation adjustment percentage","Percentage adjustment made to the valuation.","Valuation adjustment amount","Amount by which the monetary valuation was adjusted.","Invoice","Details related to the information of a commercial invoice.","Invoice identifier","Identification of an invoice by reference number.","Invoice issue date/time","Date and time of issue of an invoice.","Type of invoice code","Code specifying the type of an invoice.","Seller","Details related to the party selling merchandise to a buyer.","Seller name","Name of the party selling merchandise or services to a buyer.","Seller identi